# ---- Local NuGet package cache exception ------------------------------------
# local-packages/ ships Aether.* NuGet packages that the build references via
# NuGet.Config and need to be checked in so clones are buildable. The blanket
# *.nupkg / *.snupkg rules above would otherwise hide them, so re-include.
!local-packages/**/*.nupkg
!local-packages/**/*.snupkg
